msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4A0DC88F_34D9_40EF_ADFC_B77F3EC02EC8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You have the same flax-colored hair as me,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫but yours always seemed to glisten "
"in the sun,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hai il mio stesso colore di capelli,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫eppure i tuoi hanno sempre brillato sotto "
"al sole,"

#: scenario8:scenario8_F22859B9_3BF8_4FBD_BCCD_258FBB8B2151
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9e59970f46ddf65af5131964393aa974544daf20d2489854955e85e41e9c2eba
