msgid "⟪k:0⟫Nobody else did, though."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tuttavia, ero l’unico a pensarla così."

#: scenario8:scenario8_3FAC48C1_DFA9_4B0E_979A_DBA10D2BF36D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b10f89b9318216985084de7f6d457531950c26756109f98189474d8941e9cdac
