#: scenario8:scenario8_82E75C7D_E266_4212_B9D5_E4F4EA426959
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8c99d9f2bffb6664e9f25b1ada743da781e6b8d30095f119073ab7881df02897
