msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_82E75C7D_E266_4212_B9D5_E4F4EA426959"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I knew I would eventually have to find some kind of work—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫some way to support "
"myself and Nellie—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sapevo che prima o poi avrei dovuto cercare qualche lavoro—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫un modo per "
"mantenere sia me che Nellie—"

#: scenario8:scenario8_52024431_DA1B_4142_8E3B_0376C8AE6A45
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2b612d621ab6cb9e1df2ad2978ab19fda698db6ffc0f992345c8060594e2d4ff
