"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That’s the idea.⟪k:3⟫You like chicken though, don’t you?⟪k:4⟫Steamed especially, "
"if I remember right?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Era quella l’idea.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫A te piace il pollo, no?⟪k:5⟫Specialmente cotto al "
"vapore, se non ricordo male..."

