#: scenario8:scenario8_DAB41E07_DF84_4B13_833C_A3FB7DE62410
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a77ba99423d5749d7e9831a457b21d6a1bbe8abfa3753e94fd947fb511e87b9d
