msgid "⟪k:0⟫Had I stepped into territory man was never supposed to enter?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Avevo messo piede in un territorio in cui non sarei mai dovuto entrare?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_37304628_44A9_4C1C_859A_0D3C5089FE30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
