msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫There were a whole bunch of lights floating all around me, and they were changing into "
"all sorts of different colors. It was the most wonderful dream!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫C’erano un sacco di luci che mi fluttuavano attorno, e che assumevano tantissimi colori "
"diversi. ⟪k:2⟫È⟪k:3⟫ stato un sogno bellissimo!"

