"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I don’t think it would cause any problems...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Nellie isn’t the kind of "
"girl to judge someone by their looks.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫I don’t think."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non credo possa causare problemi...⟪k:3⟫ Nellie non è il tipo di ragazza che "
"giudica qualcuno dal suo aspetto...⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫ credo."

#: scenario8:scenario8_68F7D16F_B407_4ABE_9DBB_1D94818863D3
